{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_063_title", "source_sha256": "868310e193d1af0b9a0a16b18d5826a5490fe3f9410defa30dc115829fc1db4a", "ja": "なし", "zh": "无", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_063_synopsis", "source_sha256": "868310e193d1af0b9a0a16b18d5826a5490fe3f9410defa30dc115829fc1db4a", "ja": "なし", "zh": "无", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_063_1000_p", "source_sha256": "31d70dd553fc46e2a0269913e0e6c46f1d00ef3c69736063c3804b539215bce2", "ja": "亜美、真美、ジュリア。お疲れさま。\nなにを話していたんだ？", "zh": "亚美、真美、茱莉亚。辛苦了。\n刚才在聊什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_063_1001_011ami", "source_sha256": "726e7ac575bac81198d8a7c578c0c28ac683efd2c636772d62282ae2a1333fba", "ja": "お、噂をすれば兄ちゃん！　はろはろ～。", "zh": "哦，说曹操曹操到，哥哥！哈喽哈喽～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_063_1002_050jul", "source_sha256": "1eba95ee7ca8f78d44bb41403f620d9f4d46623d347966274401945b8e18ddb1", "ja": "気をつけた方がいいぜ。あんたが疲れたところを\n狙って、真美が必殺技をかけるってさ。", "zh": "你最好小心点。听说真美会趁你疲惫的时候，给你来一记必杀技。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_063_1003_p", "source_sha256": "4dc82d1c96736691c7c78589946cc74f26406e0a547bc48308ce8f664154d4d6", "ja": "必殺技？　な、なんだそれは？", "zh": "必杀技？什、那是什么啊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_063_1004_012mam", "source_sha256": "0009a61c2da271fc55316ede412ae262baf9e8c5e235ce84bd85ad8694cd8372", "ja": "大丈夫、たぶん痛くないから♪\nさあ、目をつむって……にじにじ……。", "zh": "没事的，大概不会痛的啦♪\n来，闭上眼睛……慢慢凑近……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_063_1005_p", "source_sha256": "30674920d344a496e017a57f7a25f640d5ec797df62e9e2154eabac4dcfdddb1", "ja": "うわ、一体なにを……って、そんな話をしに来た\nわけじゃない。亜美と真美に、新曲が届いたんだ！", "zh": "呜哇，你到底要干什么……不对，我可不是来聊这个的。亚美和真美收到新歌了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_063_1006_011ami", "source_sha256": "9ce12e7df174cebe84ef39ec934df71051d5b77591931c71cf28c7aead2edad7", "ja": "えっ！？", "zh": "咦！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_063_1007_012mam", "source_sha256": "9ce12e7df174cebe84ef39ec934df71051d5b77591931c71cf28c7aead2edad7", "ja": "えっ！？", "zh": "咦！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_063_1008_p", "source_sha256": "d1b3454e15f3c17c69d7d2725571172416d75333a4ace6c967f0fd1fb3565ad4", "ja": "すごく壮大でいい曲だぞ。ふたりには、ちょっと前に\n公演してもらったけど、反響もふたり分だったから……", "zh": "是一首非常宏大、很棒的歌曲。之前让你们两个人一起演出过，不过反响也是两人份的，所以……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_063_1009_p", "source_sha256": "8ca6803af3e03398548d5ec9e95bec6189b29bdee30f0fad8ba2937e90fdfcbd", "ja": "この新曲をひっさげて、またふたりで、\nセンター公演をしてもらおうと思ってる！", "zh": "我想让你们两位带着这首新歌，再次一起举办中心公演！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_063_1010_011ami", "source_sha256": "6daf539831995457051f5ea726fdb54549d6146103e8da88de1e9080b0c0a1dd", "ja": "やったー！！", "zh": "太棒啦——！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_063_1011_012mam", "source_sha256": "6daf539831995457051f5ea726fdb54549d6146103e8da88de1e9080b0c0a1dd", "ja": "やったー！！", "zh": "太棒啦——！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_063_1012_011ami", "source_sha256": "eab95bfda3dee4ac0579fa2e8b703f9f35930a5644a7d7f0de9bf74dd9d5c1eb", "ja": "やるやる、やるよね真美！？", "zh": "要做要做的，真美也做对吧！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_063_1013_012mam", "source_sha256": "766744d33c91c848ee732e7f83988cd85e3c6a212894e2dad01efd46a3a0c4d3", "ja": "やるやる、やりまくるよ亜美！！\n今度はなにするんだっけ？　へろもん対決だっけ？？", "zh": "做做做，真美要大做特做哦亚美！！\n下次是要做什么来着？费洛蒙大对决来着？？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_063_1014_p", "source_sha256": "3a3c0fe44fb638aa1c519cbd1a0615e2a81cb469e677bcdebc2129d1295f88b6", "ja": "それはしなくていいが、やる気があるのは良いことだ。\n楽しみにしてるぞ！", "zh": "那个不用做，不过有干劲是好事。\n我很期待哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_063_1015_050jul", "source_sha256": "0de7739e33214075bdbd975a694a2878cdd75004edc4acc9a2e21bb13a3f3619", "ja": "へえ、ふたりの夢は、うっすら正夢だったのかもな。\nがんばれよ！", "zh": "哦，原来你们两个人的梦想，或许也算是隐约成真了啊。\n加油啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_063_1016_045kar", "source_sha256": "eef18b65048c9036eb7f5cc43c28c1760813bacac83bb5e7faa1b307199654af", "ja": "こ、こんにちは……。あ、あの……\nどうしたんですか？", "zh": "那、那个，你好……。请、请问……\n是怎么了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_063_1017_010azu", "source_sha256": "d81e2bcee8e81bb7b693c893abcb4f8cc00d810de4d4b65f69133da63953e612", "ja": "お部屋の外まで、みんなの楽しそうな声が\n響いていますよ～。うふふ♪", "zh": "连房间外都能听到大家开心的声音呢～。呵呵♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_063_1018_050jul", "source_sha256": "9eba333daf9c44ce50370614cf6965dab00e87a9f0f6c00aeb10d280559ed58d", "ja": "ああ、カレン、あず姉。亜美と真美が、\nまたセンター公演をやるってさ！", "zh": "啊，卡莲、梓姐。听说亚美和真美又要举办中心公演了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_063_1019_010azu", "source_sha256": "5087c3f3ee2c164214ded2728538f81400fecef1c31d189eaa505be2840acb17", "ja": "まぁ、素敵ね！　じゃあ{$P$}さん、\n私にもお手伝いさせてもらえますか？", "zh": "哎呀，真棒呢！那么{$P$}先生，\n也能让我来帮帮忙吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_063_1020_045kar", "source_sha256": "4e6b1ce6fa970e0e1d9636f47a8255f094d85eefa71e2ad8286322f96142de94", "ja": "わ、私も……！　亜美ちゃんと真美ちゃんの公演は、\nとっても楽しくて……す、好きなんです……♪", "zh": "我、我也……！亚美和真美的演出特别有意思……我、我很喜欢……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_063_1021_p", "source_sha256": "46758cf2a603b1f4a1ce5c6c03343ec257ada30fe41807fe8b45e3c56b9bbae1", "ja": "むしろ、お願いできると助かります。\nふたりに出てもらえると、俺も安心だし。", "zh": "倒不如说，你们愿意帮忙就太好了。\n有你们两位出演，我也能放心不少。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_063_1022_011ami", "source_sha256": "7307f68cc46e7b67068ed6f744a371cac9d65334caaf36b3a39365e0a4ec89c9", "ja": "わーい！　あずさお姉ちゃん、しのみやん、\nよろしくね！　ついでにぷぅちゃんもね！", "zh": "好耶！梓姐姐、可怜，拜托你们啦！顺便还有小噗哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_063_1023_050jul", "source_sha256": "d7edb67ff6ad8d931bec3d06cf0532cc3e3d08e648598f90f9b6d77218a31080", "ja": "ついでってなんだよ！　まあ、最初から\n出るつもりだったけどさ……。", "zh": "什么叫顺便啊！不过，我本来就打算参加就是了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_063_1024_012mam", "source_sha256": "211a81fb581214a71e62d1646abb3baaa1bfd2978f9057a7576cba7cddf29a13", "ja": "いや～、最強のパーティーが完成しましたな。\n公演の成功は決まりだね！　レッスンもいらないよね♪", "zh": "哎呀～，最强的队伍组建完成了呢。\n演出肯定能大获成功啦！也不用特训了吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_063_1025_p", "source_sha256": "33a74320f16f432dc4cadd4ec9f2a02d136f7773456242224f940f1f38b5bc5a", "ja": "レッスンはいるぞ。\nということで、早速ですけど……、あずささん。", "zh": "需要排练啊。\n那么，事不宜迟……あずさ小姐。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_063_1026_p", "source_sha256": "7b706a8ce89db2a08a7ee80b4331efdf867ff0aad4aeb3fd0fd7ad4f69d0009b", "ja": "すみませんが、これから当分の間、メンバーでの\nレッスンの仕切りをお願いしていいですか？", "zh": "不好意思，接下来这段时间，能请您负责安排成员们的训练吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_063_1027_010azu", "source_sha256": "75090e8e4d75dc298fce41aa12f86bc3fbe2b044775244bd74a5f831fe34a429", "ja": "はい、もちろん構いませんよ。がんばります♪\n……公演の準備、お忙しいんですね？", "zh": "好的，当然没问题。我会加油的♪\n……演出的准备工作很忙吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_063_1028_p", "source_sha256": "7909fee15d338ac5cc286c950c36a325d036320a30f9b8f285b9e82c92a0ca78", "ja": "そうですね、ちょっと……。次の公演は、曲に合わせた\n宇宙っぽい演出を考えているんですけど……。", "zh": "是啊，有一点……下次公演我正在考虑配合歌曲设计一些宇宙风格的演出，不过……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_063_1029_p", "source_sha256": "3a65552a0be155ba8ea88b897f3041be50f6967fd5598f2760e139933b0ea3be", "ja": "宇宙だけに奥深いというか、調べるものが多くて。今日\nもこれから資料を集めに行ってきます。……ふわあ。", "zh": "毕竟和宇宙有关，该说它深奥呢，要查的东西太多了。今天\n接下来也得去收集资料。……哈啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_063_1030_045kar", "source_sha256": "bcb800151693e73251a6b623a80409ea180ade7e0fc31874278a13568a558ada", "ja": "……{$P$}さん、疲れてます……。\nあ、あの、ちゃんと眠れてますか？", "zh": "……{$P$}先生，你看起来好累……\n那、那个，你平时有好好睡觉吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_063_1031_p", "source_sha256": "74f4f4f10c857268d60646e31996ad9d79a8d32b5967e11f0120f85eed43a893", "ja": "おっと、ごめんごめん。まあ寝不足気味だけど、\n大丈夫だよ。仕事には影響が出ないようにするから。", "zh": "哎呀，抱歉抱歉。虽然有点睡眠不足，不过没关系。我会注意不让工作受到影响的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_063_1032_012mam", "source_sha256": "61be663117ae3450311e41c523b0ebcbad56fbf3d14e4539c3c52588c9fe7f36", "ja": "キラーン☆　やっぱね！　今こそ、\n真美が百年修行してエトクした必殺技の出番だよ！", "zh": "闪亮☆果然如此！现在正是\n真美修行百年学会的必杀技登场的时候！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_063_1033_050jul", "source_sha256": "c5e4845877c8378db77946d6bff3c00658632a6b5136f7b090ab37a5bc8e7fa3", "ja": "いつから修行してたんだよ？\nつーか必殺技って結局、何なんだ？", "zh": "你什么时候修行的啊？\n话说那必杀技到底是什么玩意啊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_063_1034_011ami", "source_sha256": "abfeb5a32fdb8542318a0e0c118e88a554070c16f9fd7d2778ab3cf992613541", "ja": "えっとね、夜ぐっすり寝れるっていうサイミン術！\nこないだ夢怪人ネムラシアンが使ってたんだよ♪", "zh": "那个嘛，是能让人晚上睡得香的催眠术！\n前些天梦怪人涅姆拉希安用过哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_063_1035_p", "source_sha256": "5c706d5246b632861e047f71914e1a27209cd92c9de0f1c41d9d657fafd27b43", "ja": "どんなアニメか知らないが、親切な怪人だな……。\nまあ、それで本当にグッスリ眠れるなら助かるけど。", "zh": "虽然不知道是哪部动画，但还真是个热心的怪人啊……\n不过，要是真能让人睡得香，那可就帮大忙了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
